00:09:15.015 --> 00:09:19.155
And then after that I got my
master's degree in the US again,

00:09:19.155 --> 00:09:20.594
which was another two years.

00:09:21.305 --> 00:09:22.015
In what subject?

00:09:22.824 --> 00:09:23.535
In business.

00:09:24.405 --> 00:09:24.895
Okay.

00:09:25.935 --> 00:09:31.605
So yeah, it was, uh, I've lived
in the US quite for quite a while.

00:09:31.635 --> 00:09:36.495
Um, but mm-hmm , the other languages
that I learned, I really learned kind of

00:09:36.495 --> 00:09:38.715
