00:09:58.829 --> 00:10:02.069
But yeah, it was always for me,
learn the language before you land.

00:10:02.130 --> 00:10:04.079
That's, that's just
how my life turned out.

00:10:04.290 --> 00:10:08.280
Not there's anything wrong with doing it
the other way around, but in my case...

00:10:08.280 --> 00:10:08.699
your way.

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:12.510
Your way is so much better because you
arrive, you hit the ground running,

00:10:12.510 --> 00:10:14.040
you can make friends with the locals.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.080
You can really build on it.

00:10:16.319 --> 00:10:19.260
If you arrive hoping that just by
being there, you're gonna learn the

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.840
language, I think you're in most
cases going to be disappointed.

00:10:22.230 --> 00:10:25.890
You basically settle into a pattern
of living with other expats and

00:10:25.890 --> 00:10:27.449
